OL,4,CGhana's new $60m presidential jet      
OL,5,Csparks public outrage                  
OL,6,GGhana's government has defended its    
OL,7,Gpurchase of a new presidential jet     
OL,8,Gamid criticism over its cost, as many  
OL,9,Gcitizens continue to struggle with the 
OL,10,Ghigh cost of living.                   
OL,12,FThe $60m (#46m) French-made Falcon 6X  
OL,13,Fhas sparked a political row, with      
OL,14,Fopposition politicians accusing        
OL,15,FPresident John Mahama's administration 
OL,16,Fof misplaced priorities.               
OL,18,FBut the government says the purchase   
OL,19,Fis justified, arguing that Ghana's     
OL,20,Fimproving economy makes the aircraft   
OL,21,Faffordable and is needed to replace an 
OL,22,Fageing presidential jet.               
